<title>USA: IPC Holdings sets special dividend.</title>
<headline>IPC Holdings sets special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>IPC Holdings, a Bermuda-based reinsurer, said its board has declared a special dividend of $1.00 a share, in addition to its quarterly dividend of $0.3175 a share.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable June 26, 1997 to shareholders of record on June 10, IPC said.</p>
<p>IPC has about 26 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
